TiDaoji/infinity_hook
=====================

Ported and modified from the InfinityHook Pro lineage used in CR Full
(SakDriver/infinity_hook_pro), itself based on:

- everdox/InfinityHook
- FiYHer/InfinityHookPro (Win10 1909+ / Win11 clock paths)

Modifications for TiDaoji (PR2):
- Fix IsStarted / Stop no-op bug (IsStarted set true only after full Start)
- CKCL SYSTEMCALL enable moved to Start (not Initialize)
- Strategy A: Repair() + DetectThread only repairs layer B
- Cleanup() / RollbackStartPartial for failed Start
- ConflictProbe must not treat GetCpuClock==2 alone as conflict
- Pool tag 'Tdji'

This engine is NOT PG-safe. Long-lived CKCL/GetCpuClock/Hvl/Halp mutations remain
while the driver is loaded. DSU restore of DSE is unrelated to unloading hooks.
